<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Reset Your Password - Neuro-chord</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
            background-color: #0f172a;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            color: #f8fafc;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 20px auto;
            background-color: #1e293b;
            border-radius: 16px;
            overflow: hidden;
            border: 1px solid #334155;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 25px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
        }
        .header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f43f5e 0%, #fb923c 100%);
            padding: 40px 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .header h1 {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: -0.025em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: #ffffff;
        }
        .content {
            padding: 40px 35px;
            line-height: 1.7;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .title {
            font-size: 22px;
            color: #f1f5f9;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            font-weight: 700;
        }
        .description {
            color: #94a3b8;
            font-size: 15px;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }
        /* Stylizacja PINu */
        .pin-container {
            background-color: #0f172a;
            border: 2px dashed #334155;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 25px;
            margin: 30px 0;
            display: inline-block;
        }
        .pin-code {
            font-family: 'Monaco', 'Consolas', monospace;
            font-size: 42px;
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: 12px;
            color: #fb923c;
            text-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(251, 146, 60, 0.3);
            margin-left: 12px; /* wyrównanie letter-spacing */
        }
        .expiry-note {
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #64748b;
            margin-top: 30px;
            font-style: italic;
        }
        .footer {
            background-color: #0f172a;
            padding: 30px;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #475569;
            border-top: 1px solid #1e293b;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h1>Neuro-chord</h1>
        </div>
        <div class="content">
            <h2 class="title">Verification Code</h2>
            <p class="description">
                Use the following 6-digit code to complete your password reset request.
            </p>
            
            <div class="pin-container">
                <div class="pin-code">{{pin}}</div>
            </div>
            
            <p class="description" style="font-size: 14px; margin-top: 20px;">
                Enter this code in the application to proceed with setting a new password.
            </p>
            
            <p class="expiry-note">
                This code is valid for <strong>15 minutes</strong> for security reasons.
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="footer">
            &copy; 2026 Neuro-chord Systems. Secure Access.<br>
            If you didn't request a password reset, please secure your account.
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>